        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-714, Distressed Beehive Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are looking for a quaint knob with country charm, this knob is for you. The Beehive Cabinet Knob features ribbed detailing that will bring so much charm to any kitchen or bathroom cabinet. It is available in 2 sizes: 1-1/16 inches and 1-13/16 inches. Choose any of the 5 available finishes and bring this cute knob home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/honey-dipper-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-813\"><b>Matching Honey Dipper Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-714 Ribbed Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-714:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-713:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
